    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m just a repeat of everything that went wrong in my family. everything they went through, the drinking, the accidents, the way everyone just breaks down... it’s like it’s written in my dna or something. i feel like i’m just carrying all this weight and i’m failing at it. it’s like i’m just a link in a chain of misery and it never ends.",
